  "helpTitle": "Help and contact",
  "helpFaq": "Frequently asked questions",
  "helpQ1": "What is WinPlus?",
  "helpA1": "WinPlus prepares students for exams and competitive exams in Cameroon: corrected past papers, interactive exercises and WinAI, available at any time, from BEPC to the major competitive exams (ENSP, FMSB, ENS…).",
  "helpQ2": "Who can use WinPlus?",
  "helpA2": "Students of all levels, parents following their children, teachers and schools.",
  "helpQ3": "How much does the subscription cost?",
  "helpA3": "The Free plan lets you discover WinPlus. Paid plans (student, parent, teacher) and their prices per month, quarter and year are in “Subscription”.",
  "helpQ4": "How do I reset my password?",
  "helpA4": "On the sign-in screen, tap “Forgot password”, enter your e-mail and follow the instructions you receive.",
  "helpQ5": "Can I read past papers offline?",
  "helpA5": "No: past papers are read in the WinPlus viewer, online, and cannot be downloaded. Course lessons, however, can be saved to watch without a connection.",
  "helpQ6": "Which payment methods?",
  "helpA6": "In the app, you pay with Mobile Money (MTN, Orange) or with your WinPlus wallet balance.",
  "helpQ7": "Can I cancel my subscription?",
  "helpA7": "Yes, at any time from “Subscription”. Cancellation takes effect at the end of the current period.",
  "helpQ8": "What connection do I need?",
  "helpA8": "1 to 2 Mbit/s is enough to browse; HD videos need at least 5 Mbit/s. Offline, screens you already opened stay readable and your actions are sent when you are back online.",
  "helpWrite": "Write to us",
  "helpWriteText": "A question, a payment or account issue? Write to support: your e-mail app opens with the message ready to complete.",
